        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūng'ung'uula kwa basugi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a batobisha ba goodi na a banhū a bangī a ba shibi, bang'wegeelaga kūndegeleka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bafalisayo na a balangi ba shilagīlo bandya kūng'ung'uula balīhaya gīkī, “Ū munhū ng'wenūyū akwanukūlaga banhū ba shibi; nīyo nī shilīwa akūlyaga nabo!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūsumo lwa ndīīmi na ng'holo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yesu ūbawīla lūsumo ūlū ūhaya gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ī gīsī nani ū mu bing'we ūlū ūbiza alī na ng'holo igana hūna ūjimīīja īmò yajo, ūyo atūjileka ījo makūmi kenda na kenda kū matogolo, ūja akwīkoobaga īyo yatagalījaga, kūshisha aho alayīpandīkīle? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū wīpandīka akūyega no; nīyo hangī akwīsesela ha mabega, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ītwale kaya. Wa kūhayīshisha ū kū kaya, ūbakuminga banwani biye na bazenganwa; ūbawīla gīkī, ‘Bing'we nzūgi tūyege, nguno nīpandīka ī ng'holo yane īyo yalī yajimīīlile!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīmuwīla h'ūmo būlī nū būyegi bo ng'wigūlū kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa munhū nkenaagūji ūmò ūlū ūgalūka; kūtinda batūngīlīja makūmi kenda na kenda abo batī na nguno ya kūgalūka!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūsumo Lwa nkīma na hela yakwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nūūlū hangī, alīho nkīma kī ūlū alī na hela",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Hela:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ī hela ījo jilīhayiwa, būlī yene ū mpango gwayo gwalī shilingi shihūmbī shingī.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " jakwe ikūmi, hūna ūjimīīja īmò yajo, ūyo atīko kūbacha tala nūūlū na kūpyagūla ū mu kaya akwīkoobaga mu welwa ng'holò, kūshisha aho alayīpandīkīle? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū wīpandīka ū būyegi bokwe būkūbiza būtaale no, kūshisha nose akwitana binhya biye na bazenganwa biye abawīle gīkī, ‘ī hela yane īyī yalī yajimīīlaga nīpandīka; nzūgi tūyege hamò!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīmuwīla h'ūmo būkabizīlaga ū būyegi nū kū bamalaika ba ng'wa Mulungu, kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa munhū ūmò nkenaagūji ūlū ūgalūka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būtogwa bo namhala kū bitūnja bakwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī ūhaya, “Munhū nebe walī na bitūnja babīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ndo wabo ūng'wīla ū ise gīkī, ‘Baba ninhage ū nene ū ngabo go wingīji bone.’ Ū namhala ūbagabanhya ī sabo yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jitabītile shikū ningī, ū ndo ūkumingīja pyī ī shikolo shakwe, ūhūlūja ajile kū masī ga kūle. Ūūkajimala ī sabo jakwe kūjiponanja mu nzīla ja sagala sagala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wamala pyī ī shikolo shakwe, kwimanīla yagwa nzala nhaale pye a hose ū mu sī yenīyo, ūbiza na makoye mataale no! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūja ha ling'wana ijigajiga lya mu sī yenīyo, lyūkang'winha nīmo gwa kūyūdīīma ngulubī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūyikūmva kūlya a mūūla ayo jalyaga ī ngulubī, gwike walī atīho nūūlū ūmò wa kūng'winha shose shose! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho giyegeela a masala, wiwīla gīkī, ‘Ū baba alī na bitūmamīja ba mheela banga abo bakūlyaga shilīwa bigūta bashileka na kūshileka, alīyo ū nene ūūyū nalībūlagwa nzala aha! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gete naje ū kūlī baba nakangwīle mu magūlū nang'wīle gīkī, “Baba naahūbile ū ng'wigūlū nū kūlī bebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natigeleelilwe ū kwitanwa gīkī nalī ng'wana wako hangī; nīītage kūbiza ūmò wa batūmami bako!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ūbūūka ūja ū kūlī ise, alīyo aho ataalī kūle, ū ise ūnoleela, ūnsaatwa. Ūnsūng'wanha bo nhambo. Ūūkashikīla kūngwīla ūnkumbatīla mu nhingo, kūnū akūmbipaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei ū nyanda wandya kūng'wibūūlīla ū ise alīhaya gīkī, ‘Baba nalī ng'hūbi no, ū ng'wigūlū nū kūlī bebe; natigeleelilwe ū kwitanwa gīkī nalī ng'wana wako!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ise ūbawīla a batūmami gīkī, ‘Bing'we enhagi wangū shizwalo shawiza ng'wize munzwalīkīje; ng'wenhe na pete munzwalīkīje ū kū lwala lokwe, na shilatū sha kūzwala ū kū mhambala jakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mūūga ya ng'ombe, ī ng'īnu, yenhagi nayo ng'wīsīnze; tūlye tūyege! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū ng'witūnja wane ng'wenūyū wapūlūgūkaga kwīnga mu kūcha, wilongaga kwīnga mu kūjimīīla!’ Bandya ng'hana kūyega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū ng'witūnja wakwe ū ntaale akasangwa olī kū ngūnda, aho aliza wahayegeela a ha kaya, ūyigwa ī mbina, nī mhūndū jilīzīlīng'hanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'witana ūmò wa badinha a batūmami, ūmūja a makūlū ga mihayo yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūng'wīla gīkī, ‘Wizaga ū nzunayo, ū namhala wamūlagīlaga ī mūūga ya ng'ombe ī ng'īnu, nguno wampandīkaga alī mhola o gīlī gīlī!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū wei akapelana no, wisukūla; ūlema nū kwingīla ū mu kaya. Ūfuma ū ise kūng'wikūmbīlīja ingīle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūshosha alīng'wīla ū ise gīkī, ‘Ū bebe ng'wenekīlī ūmanile gete, gīkī ī myaka na myaka pyī ī yose īyī, nalīho aha nakūkūtūmamīlaga, nataalī kūkenaagūla nūūlū shilagīlo shako shimò na hado yaya; ī gīsī oninha kī ū nene? Angū ndūhū nūūlū ni kabūli kamò dūhū, gīkī nane nalye nayege na basūmba bichane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo aho wiza ū ng'wana wako, ū ng'wene wantona ing'ombe gete; alīyo hū wakajiponangije ī sabo jako sagala sagala, akūlyaga na mamalahya!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū ise ūnshokeja ūng'wīla, ‘Ng'wana wane, ū bebe ūlī ha kaya aha pyī ī shikū; pyī ī shikolo shane shilī shako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana shitwigeleelilwe tūyege na kūtambīīla, nguno ū nzunayo ng'wenūyū wapūlūgūkaga kwīnga mu kūcha, wilongaga kūfuma mu kūjimīīla.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
